  "notes": "キャラ is short for キャラクター (character). Very common in casual speech.\n\nSENSE 1 - FICTIONAL CHARACTER:\n- {人気|にんき}キャラ: popular character\n- {主人公|しゅじんこう}キャラ: protagonist character\n- サブキャラ: supporting character\n- キャラデザ (キャラクターデザイン): character design\n\nSENSE 2 - PERSONAL ROLE/PERSONA:\n- キャラが{立|た}つ: to have a distinctive personality\n- キャラが{被|かぶ}る: to have overlapping personalities\n- いじられキャラ: person who gets teased\n- {天然|てんねん}キャラ: airheaded personality\n- キャラ{変|へん}: changing one's persona\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ゆるキャラ: cute local mascot character",
